    "description": "Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can boost the competence of one of your allies within 6 squares. That individual gains the ability to make a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> using your Skill modifier (except <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a>); this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> must be made before the end of the encounter, or the benefit is lost.<br><br>You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you gain one additional use of this Talent per encounter.",
